SUMMARY:Winter 2026 - Wheelchair Basketball - Winter 2026
LOCATION:Gym 2A
DESCRIPTION:Wheelchair basketball is a style of basketball played using a sports wheelchair. These sessions are designed to learn about the sport of wheelchair basketball and encourage our local Queen’s and Kingston communities\, with or without a disability\, to be physically active! The inclusive program generates awareness for parasport and promotes positive attitudinal change toward disability.
